      ],
      "text": "22–23\nWhich TWO of the following statements are true of the researchers at London\nZoo?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        256.23468017578125,
        497.3360900878906,
        294.9526062011719
      ],
      "text": "A. They are hoping to expand the numbers of different corals being bred in\nlaboratories.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        295.9546813964844,
        478.9289245605469,
        334.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "B. They want to identify corals that can cope well with the changed sea\nconditions.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        335.6746826171875,
        525.9000244140625,
        394.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "C. They are looking at ways of creating artificial reefs that corals could grow on.\nD. They are trying out methods that would speed up reproduction in some\ncorals.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        395.314697265625,
        479.6077575683594,
        434.0335998535156
      ],
      "text": "E. They are investigating materials that might protect reefs from higher\ntemperatures.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        478.7710266113281,
        254.90811157226562,
        498.2724304199219
      ],
      "text": "Complete the sentences below.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        510.571044921875,
        419.2176208496094,
        530.0724487304688
      ],
      "text": "Choose ONE WORD ONLY from the passage for each answer.\n"
    },
